{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gunbot Diplomacy",
    "steam_appid": 2800840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/9b15b9a6cdc31db10d4cd0b1db8a974c.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=240 /></span>Test your skills against the new <strong>Endless Mode</strong>! Your builds will be pushed to the limit by stronger champion enemies, even more dangerous boss levels and infinite scaling. How hard can you break the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also featuring: Banishes to control shop RNG, powerups to give you a boost at critical moments, and lots of new content (maps, weapons, modules, and an evolve) to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/8d8bbe3cb73cd9d0f0e0022dc644fbd2.poster.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/8d8bbe3cb73cd9d0f0e0022dc644fbd2.webm?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/8d8bbe3cb73cd9d0f0e0022dc644fbd2.mp4?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the perfect arsenal of weapons, from nuclear footballs to fire extinguishers that spray electrified flames. Rewire your Gunbot - frame and (artificial) brain - whether it's for speed, durability, or straight up firepower. Welcome to the wasteland; now pick your flavor of carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Infinite replayability!</strong> No two bots are the same, so no two runs are the same! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mix and match from<strong> over 20 base weapons</strong> and customize them using <strong>25+ types of augments and boosters</strong> to suit your build on a <strong>unique hexagonal upgrade grid</strong>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.poster.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.webm?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.mp4?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from <strong>more than 80 build-defining modules</strong> - it's not like messing with Gunbot AI lead to the downfall of all human civilization or anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Fast-paced gameplay: let your weapons do the talking and splatter your enemies across the desert, while you dodge out of harm's way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>10 base Gunbots</strong> to choose from, from the gallant <i>LanceBot</i> to the <i>Freezer</i>, the best armed fridge the world has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover hidden combinations for <strong>special evolved weapons</strong> to kick your build into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/6d0d55ba9a02097535d994b1f49a526a.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fun and varied enemies: oozified office workers still on their 9-to-5 grind, brawl boys who just want to fight everything that moves, skittering spine-slinging crab/cactus hybrids, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special <strong>Hazard and Boss levels</strong> to test your build - and skills - in unique conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/1cb15afd67e127b14146052d4a0a612f.poster.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/1cb15afd67e127b14146052d4a0a612f.webm?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/1cb15afd67e127b14146052d4a0a612f.mp4?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let your gunbot's automated targeting systems handle the firing - or select which weapons you want to manually aim for optimal control!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/9b15b9a6cdc31db10d4cd0b1db8a974c.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=240 /></span>Test your skills against the new <strong>Endless Mode</strong>! Your builds will be pushed to the limit by stronger champion enemies, even more dangerous boss levels and infinite scaling. How hard can you break the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also featuring: Banishes to control shop RNG, powerups to give you a boost at critical moments, and lots of new content (maps, weapons, modules, and an evolve) to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/8d8bbe3cb73cd9d0f0e0022dc644fbd2.poster.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/8d8bbe3cb73cd9d0f0e0022dc644fbd2.webm?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/8d8bbe3cb73cd9d0f0e0022dc644fbd2.mp4?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the perfect arsenal of weapons, from nuclear footballs to fire extinguishers that spray electrified flames. Rewire your Gunbot - frame and (artificial) brain - whether it's for speed, durability, or straight up firepower. Welcome to the wasteland; now pick your flavor of carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Infinite replayability!</strong> No two bots are the same, so no two runs are the same! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mix and match from<strong> over 20 base weapons</strong> and customize them using <strong>25+ types of augments and boosters</strong> to suit your build on a <strong>unique hexagonal upgrade grid</strong>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.poster.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.webm?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.mp4?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from <strong>more than 80 build-defining modules</strong> - it's not like messing with Gunbot AI lead to the downfall of all human civilization or anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Fast-paced gameplay: let your weapons do the talking and splatter your enemies across the desert, while you dodge out of harm's way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>10 base Gunbots</strong> to choose from, from the gallant <i>LanceBot</i> to the <i>Freezer</i>, the best armed fridge the world has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover hidden combinations for <strong>special evolved weapons</strong> to kick your build into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/6d0d55ba9a02097535d994b1f49a526a.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fun and varied enemies: oozified office workers still on their 9-to-5 grind, brawl boys who just want to fight everything that moves, skittering spine-slinging crab/cactus hybrids, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special <strong>Hazard and Boss levels</strong> to test your build - and skills - in unique conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/1cb15afd67e127b14146052d4a0a612f.poster.avif?t=1754391038\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/1cb15afd67e127b14146052d4a0a612f.webm?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/1cb15afd67e127b14146052d4a0a612f.mp4?t=1754391038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let your gunbot's automated targeting systems handle the firing - or select which weapons you want to manually aim for optimal control!</p>",
    "short_description": "Splatter slimes, massacre mutants, and assemble your perfect Gunbot! Survive hordes of enemies in this top-down shooter roguelite by customizing your weapons on the unique upgrade grid, and pick from a wide variety of build-defining modules and wacky base bots for a new experience every run.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Ukrainian, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
